---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_stage: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_stage --> q_check_not_published: refund period ended
    q_check_stage --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_check_not_published --> q_set_merkle: results not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_set_merkle --> q_set_totals: set claimMerkleRoot, excessMerkleRoot
    q_set_totals --> [*]: set totalAcceptedCapital, totalTokensAllocated, emit ResultsPublished
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_set_merkle
        INV-001: Merkle roots are immutable once published
        INV-002: totalAcceptedCapital <= totalInvestedCapital
        INV-003: results can only be published after refund period ends
    end note
